# PLAN-797 T-06: ABI interop corpus (v2). The `probe` adapter runs the
# registered `abi/interop-v1` recipe through the abi worker (real PE
# links/runs per query step, real store on disk); every judgement is
# parent-side. The deck is `.atomdata` DATA — a case never names an
# executable.

# Leg A: AutoABI caller -> AutoABI callee. Cold publish, in-process hit,
# then a REAL worker restart keeps the store (cross-process hit), then a
# body edit (same public signature, different lowering) republishes.
```test-case
case {
  schema: "autolang.case/2"
  id: "autoabi.leg-a"
  tags: ["autoabi", "probe"]
  source: { file: "src/p797-mix.atomdata", syntax: "atom-data", path: "p797-mix.atomdata" }
  entry: { mode: "program" }
  checks: [
    { id: "leg-a", adapter: "probe", action: "run",
      options: {
        recipe: "abi/interop-v1",
        abi: { leg: "a" },
        steps: [
          { op: "query" },
          { op: "query" },
          { op: "restart" },
          { op: "query" },
          { op: "edit-source", from: "[body: mix-v1]", to: "[body: mix-v1b]" },
          { op: "query" },
          { op: "edit-source", from: "[body: mix-v1b]", to: "[body: mix-v1]" },
          { op: "query" }
        ]
      },
      expect: { completion: "success", probe: [
        { cache: "published", compute_calls: 1, stages_include: ["admit", "link-run"] },
        { cache: "hit", compute_calls: 0 },
        { cache: "hit", compute_calls: 0 },
        { cache: "published", compute_calls: 1 },
        { cache: "hit", compute_calls: 0 }
      ] } }
  ]
}
```

# Leg B: AutoABI caller -> real cl.exe C callee.
```test-case
case {
  schema: "autolang.case/2"
  id: "autoabi.leg-b"
  tags: ["autoabi", "probe"]
  source: { file: "src/p797-mix.atomdata", syntax: "atom-data", path: "p797-mix.atomdata" }
  entry: { mode: "program" }
  checks: [
    { id: "leg-b", adapter: "probe", action: "run",
      options: {
        recipe: "abi/interop-v1",
        abi: { leg: "b" },
        steps: [ { op: "query" }, { op: "query" } ]
      },
      expect: { completion: "success", probe: [
        { cache: "published", compute_calls: 2 },
        { cache: "hit", compute_calls: 0 }
      ] } }
  ]
}
```

# Leg C: C caller (own oracle/entry) -> AutoABI callee.
```test-case
case {
