    { id: "leg-c", adapter: "probe", action: "run",
      options: {
        recipe: "abi/interop-v1",
        abi: { leg: "c" },
        steps: [ { op: "query" }, { op: "query" } ]
      },
      expect: { completion: "success", probe: [
        { cache: "published", compute_calls: 2 },
        { cache: "hit", compute_calls: 0 }
      ] } }
  ]
}
```

# Negative: a deck fn-signature edit is a typed deck diagnostic (the
# discriminating descriptor-edit oracle for the formal flow) — the query
# step returns diags, never a wrong native call.
```test-case
case {
  schema: "autolang.case/2"
  id: "autoabi.bad-sig"
  tags: ["autoabi", "probe", "negative"]
  source: { file: "src/p797-mix.atomdata", syntax: "atom-data", path: "p797-mix.atomdata" }
  entry: { mode: "program" }
  checks: [
    { id: "bad-sig", adapter: "probe", action: "run",
      options: {
        recipe: "abi/interop-v1",
        abi: { leg: "a" },
        steps: [
          { op: "edit-source", from: "e:i64", to: "e:u32" },
          { op: "query" }
        ]
      },
      expect: { completion: { stage: "parse", code: "deck" }, probe: [ { } ] } }
  ]
}
```
